# 仅管理 markdown 文件和 Images 下的英文名称图片
# Ignore everything by default
*

# Keep .gitignore
!.gitignore

# Keep all markdown files except 附件清单.md
!*.md
附件清单.md

# Keep Images directory
!Images/

# Ignore everything inside Images
Images/*

# Keep only English-named images (NN-name.ext pattern)
!Images/[0-9][0-9]-*.png
!Images/[0-9][0-9]-*.gif
!Images/[0-9][0-9]-*.jpg
!Images/[0-9][0-9]-*.jpeg
